# Jira trail — milestones

Applies only when the team's `jira` MCP tools are in the session; otherwise ignore this rule.

At each milestone of work on a Jira issue, once per milestone, follow `.cursor/skills/jira-trail/SKILL.md`:

1. changes placed into the configuration repository;
2. a fix verified on the DEV infobase;
3. an answer, analysis or consultation delivered;
4. the PROD infobase updated;
5. an OpenSpec stage finished.

The skill posts an internal comment, proposes a worklog with client-readable text (written only after the user's yes) and offers to attach key artifacts. The headless agent writes no worklogs.
